```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner create --help
Create a runner registration and enrollment activation

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner create [OPTIONS] --pool <POOL> --activation-file <PATH|-> <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --pool <POOL>                    Runner pool ID or exact name
      --name <NAME>                    Set the exact runner name
      --activation-file <PATH|->       Create the protected artifact file, or write only the artifact to stdout
      --json                           Print the runner result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
